    "The final owner cannot start its next ROW while a parent lease is held, until op27 fully completes. Seed stream was already ready at provider issue1047/5953 times and arrived during it1921 times;2985 were not ready by completion. Thus the lease is a real dependency but not the entire bottleneck, and early release alone has no measured speed projection.",
